<% content_for :title, "Startup Software Development Partner | ClientFirst Labs" %>
<% content_for :meta_description, "ClientFirst Labs helps early-stage Canadian startups build MVPs, refactor prototypes, and ship production-ready software fast. Book a free founder strategy call." %>

<section class="flex justify-center items-center px-4 py-12 min-h-screen bg-background-navy md:px-8">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 justify-center items-center w-full h-full content-container lg:flex-row">
    <div class="space-y-6 w-full text-center lg:w-full lg:text-left">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl">The product development partner for <strong class="text-secondary">early-stage Canadian startups</strong></h1>
      <p class="text-base text-white sm:text-lg">We help founders ship their MVP, validate faster, and scale their product, without building a full in-house engineering team. From idea to production, we move at startup speed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex justify-center w-full">
      <%= image_tag("icons/swoosh.svg", class: "") %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%= render partial: "shared/home_nav" %>

<section id="who-we-work-with" class="px-4 py-16 bg-background-black md:px-8">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center content-container">
    <div class="mb-16 pill">
      <p class="">Who we work best with</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-16 w-full text-center">
      <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-base text-white sm:text-lg">We partner with early-stage startups that are ready to move fast. If you're building a product and need a technical partner (not just a vendor), you're in the right place.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center mt-8">
        <span class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white rounded-full bg-white/10">Pre-seed to Series A</span>
        <span class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white rounded-full bg-white/10">1–10 employees</span>
        <span class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white rounded-full bg-white/10">Founder-led teams</span>
        <span class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white rounded-full bg-white/10">MVP stage companies</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 w-full md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="p-8 rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <h3 class="mb-4">Builder Founder</h3>
        <p class="mb-6 text-white/80">You have the vision but need someone to build it. You're non-technical or semi-technical, under pressure to show traction, and need a trusted technical partner, not a dev shop that disappears after delivery.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-white/70">
          <li>→ MVP development from scratch</li>
          <li>→ Product validation & iteration</li>
          <li>→ Replace manual workflows with software</li>
          <li>→ Build your SaaS product</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="p-8 rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <h3 class="mb-4">Overloaded Technical Founder</h3>
        <p class="mb-6 text-white/80">You're writing most of the code yourself. You need capacity, architecture guidance, and a team that can ship, so you can focus on the business instead of being stuck in the codebase.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-white/70">
          <li>→ Refactor and clean up your prototype</li>
          <li>→ Extend your engineering capacity</li>
          <li>→ Ship features faster</li>
          <li>→ Add AI or third-party integrations</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-4 py-16 bg-background-navy md:px-8">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center content-container">
    <div class="mb-16 pill">
      <p class="">What we stand for</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col items-start md:flex-row md:justify-between md:gap-16">
      <div class="mb-8 w-full md:w-1/2 md:mb-0">
        <%= image_tag("Josiah-March2024-8-M.jpg", class: "rounded-xl shadow-lg w-full h-auto") %>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-10 w-full md:w-1/2">
        <div class="text-center md:text-left">
          <h3 class="">Founder-First Partnership</h3>
          <p class="">Your traction milestones drive our roadmap. We work as an extension of your founding team: listening before we build, adapting as your product evolves, and making every technical decision with your growth stage in mind. We succeed when you do.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center md:text-left">
          <h3 class="">Ship Fast, Validate First</h3>
          <p class="">We build what your users need to validate your idea, not what looks impressive in a demo. Every feature is scoped around learning and traction. We help you get to your first users, first revenue, and first signal as quickly as possible, then scale from there.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="text-center md:text-left">
          <h3 class="">Runway-Conscious Development</h3>
          <p class="">We treat your runway like it’s ours. We scope to what delivers the most value, cut what doesn’t, and give you predictable estimates grounded in real startup experience. No surprise invoices, no scope creep. Just transparent execution built around your budget.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-4 py-10 bg-background-black md:px-8">
  <div class="content-container">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="p-6 text-center rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <p class="mb-1 text-3xl font-bold text-secondary">7+</p>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-white">Years Experience</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-white/60">Senior engineering, not junior outsourcing</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 text-center rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <p class="mb-1 text-lg font-bold text-secondary">No Outsourcing</p>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-white">Direct Senior Work</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-white/60">You work with the engineer building your product</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 text-center rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <p class="mb-1 text-lg font-bold text-secondary">Startup-Paced</p>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-white">Fast Iteration</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-white/60">We move at your speed, not agency speed</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 text-center rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <p class="mb-1 text-lg font-bold text-secondary">Production</p>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-white">Complex Systems Shipped</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-white/60">Platforms built, launched, and maintained at scale</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="what-we-do" class="px-4 py-16 bg-background-navy md:px-8">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center content-container">
    <div class="mb-16 pill">
      <p class="">What we do</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex-col space-y-16 w-full">
      <div>
        <h2 class="sr-only">MVP Development</h2>
        <%= render partial: "shared/service-card", locals: {
          reverse: false,
          image_src: asset_path("web-application-dev.jpg"),
          heading: "MVP Development",
          description: "Go from idea to a production-ready MVP without wasted time or over-engineered architecture. We scope, design, and build your web application around what you need to validate. Fast. Whether you're raising a round or landing your first customers, we get you to launch with a product that’s solid, scalable, and built to grow."
        } %>
        <div class="flex justify-end mt-4">
          <%= link_to "Learn about MVP development →", mvp_development_path, class: "text-primary text-sm font-medium" %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="sr-only">Mobile App Development</h2>
        <%= render partial: "shared/service-card", locals: {
          reverse: true,
          image_src: asset_path("mobile-dev.jpg"),
          heading: "Mobile App Development",
          description: "Build a startup-grade iOS or Android app designed around user retention and product-market fit. We handle the full build from UX through deployment, so you can focus on growth instead of managing a complex mobile codebase. Optimized for performance, built to iterate quickly as your product evolves."
        } %>
        <div class="flex justify-end mt-4">
          <%= link_to "Learn about startup product development →", startup_product_development_path, class: "text-primary text-sm font-medium" %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="sr-only">Prototype to Production</h2>
        <%= render partial: "shared/service-card", locals: {
          reverse: false,
          image_src: asset_path("modernization.webp"),
          heading: "Prototype to Production",
          description: "Stuck with messy early code that’s slowing you down? We clean up prototypes, refactor unstable foundations, and add the integrations your product needs: SaaS tools, payment systems, AI workflows, and automation. Turn your proof-of-concept into a product you can confidently demo, sell, and scale."
        } %>
        <div class="flex justify-end mt-4">
          <%= link_to "Learn about prototype to production →", prototype_to_production_path, class: "text-primary text-sm font-medium" %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-4 py-16 bg-background-black md:px-8">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center content-container">
