</section>

<section class="px-4 py-16 bg-background-navy md:px-8">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center content-container">
    <div class="mb-16 pill">
      <p class="">Common startup projects</p>
    </div>

    <p class="mb-16 max-w-2xl text-base text-center text-white sm:text-lg">Not sure exactly what you need? Here are the projects we get pulled into most often by early-stage founders.</p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 w-full sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <h3 class="mb-3 text-lg">MVP Development</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/70">You have a validated idea and need a working product. We scope and build your MVP: fast, focused, and production-ready.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <h3 class="mb-3 text-lg">Prototype Refactoring</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/70">Your early prototype got you this far. Now it needs a clean foundation before you scale. We restructure it so your team can move fast without breaking things.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <h3 class="mb-3 text-lg">SaaS Integrations</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/70">Connect your product to Stripe, Twilio, HubSpot, or any third-party tool your business runs on. We own the integration end-to-end.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <h3 class="mb-3 text-lg">AI & Automation for Startups</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/70">Add AI-powered features, automate internal workflows, or embed LLMs into your product. We make AI practical, not just a feature on a roadmap.</p>
        <%= link_to "Learn more →", ai_automation_path, class: "text-primary text-xs font-medium mt-3 inline-block" %>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <h3 class="mb-3 text-lg">Replace Manual Workflows</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/70">Still running operations on spreadsheets or manual processes? We build lightweight internal tools and automations that eliminate bottlenecks as you scale.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

